    "text": "wcti12.com\nwebsite\nMaysville\nHistoric train depot in Maysville transformed into workforce center\nBy Valentina Wilson,6 hours ago\nA historic train depot in Jones County has been given a new lease on life as a workforce development center. The town of Maysville will celebrate this transformation with a ribbon-cutting ceremony scheduled for 11:30 a.m. Thursday, June 26. Town Manager Schumata Brown said the renovations cost $750,000, funded by...\n1\nComments\nLoading editor...",
